text = "A Beginner's Guide to Alchemy"

[node name="GettingStartedLabel" type="Label" parent="MarginContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=608831245]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
text = "Welcome to your potion shop!

Your job is to prepare magical ingredients, brew potions and sell them to customers."

[node name="IngredientsLabel" type="Label" parent="MarginContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=1679714909]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
text = "1. Collect ingredients

Open your pantry to find your available ingredients. You'll start with Apples and Spark Thistles."

[node name="ProcessingLabel" type="Label" parent="MarginContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=1474258961]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
text = "2. Prepare your ingredients

Ingredients must be processed before they can be added to the cauldron.

Use the preparation stations to crush or decoct ingredients. Different processes can change their alchemical properties."

[node name="BrewingLabel" type="Label" parent="MarginContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=365933758]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
text = "3. Brew a potion

Place your prepared ingredients into the cauldron and brew your potion.

Experiment with different ingredients and processes to discover their effects."

[node name="CustomersLabel" type="Label" parent="MarginContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=1334275448]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
text = "4. Serve your customers

Talk to customers to learn which effects they need.

Once you've made a suitable potion, drag it onto the customer's potion acceptance area to complete the sale."

[node name="ForestLabel" type="Label" parent="MarginContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=2024420236]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
text = "5. Explore the magical forest

The portal becomes available on your second day.

Venture into the forest to discover additional ingredients for your potions."
